    description: "Filed during fundamental concept audit 2026-05-27 (provenance fields on IR dataclasses).\n\norigin_run_signature is declared on Symbol (ir.py:374) and Edge (ir.py:573), serialized in to_dict and deserialized in from_dict, but:\n- Zero producers ever set it (not in any analyzer or linker)\n- Zero consumers read it outside ser/deser\n- 13 total references, all in ir.py or test fixtures\n- Always None in fresh analysis output\n\nThe intended purpose was to link entities to their creating AnalysisRun's run_signature for config-based grouping. That link was never wired. The field is pure dead weight.\n\nFix: deprecate in next minor, remove in next schema bump. Update from_dict to silently ignore the key for back-compat with old JSON. Remove the field from Symbol and Edge dataclasses."  # be44
    fields: {}  # be44
